1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,200
Welcome back to The Growth Blueprint. Today we are breaking down why SaaS companies fail their pricing models.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,100
Most founders think pricing is about matching competitors, but it is really about aligning your value metric with customer success.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:15,000
If you charge per seat when your product creates value through automated background tasks, you disincentivize team adoption.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,300
In our portfolio, switching from seat-based tiers to usage-correlated pricing increased net revenue retention from 104% to 138%.
